Here’s the full alphabetized system.

A–Z silence alphabet

Letter	Name	Meaning	Suggested Glyph
A	Absolute Silence	No signal / acoustic zero	∅
B	Breath Silence	Tiny intake / reset before speech or song	˘
C	Comfortable Silence	Safe, shared quiet	~
D	Dramatic Silence	Pause for emphasis / reveal	!
E	Elliptical Silence	Omitted content to be inferred	…
F	Foreshadowing Silence	Missing expected signal hints at change	?̶
G	Generative Silence	Open space for creation	◇
H	Hushed Silence	Quieting / lowering expressive intensity	↘
I	Intimidating Silence	Pressuring nonresponse	▌
J	Judicial Silence	Refusal pending evidence / deliberate withholding of judgment	⚖
K	Kept Silence	Secret-keeping / protected information	⌂
L	Liturgical Silence	Sacred, ritual, reverent stillness	✶
M	Memorial Silence	Remembering through absence	†
N	Negative-Space Silence	What is absent defines meaning	□
O	Omissive Silence	Deliberate leaving out of a specific part	⊘
P	Pregnant Silence	Charged with expectation	◔
Q	Questioning Silence	Pause that asks without words	?
R	Rhythmic Silence	Musical rest / beat-space	𝄽
S	Selective Silence	One audience hears, another does not	⇢∅
